{"id":"642808","name":"炸鸡排","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/642808/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"一块"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"面包糠","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡胸肉切片，用刀背剁肉，剁松散。","img":"images/642808/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放适量五香粉，蚝油，生抽，胡椒粉，白砂糖，搅拌匀，腌制一小时。","img":"images/642808/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备适量面粉，鸡蛋液，面包糠。首先两面粘上面粉。","img":"images/642808/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后两面裹上蛋液。","img":"images/642808/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"后两面粘上面包糠。","img":"images/642808/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"中小火炸至两面金黄。","img":"images/642808/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"滤油。","img":"images/642808/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盛盘。可以切条沾番茄酱吃。","img":"images/642808/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}